<title>USA: Indosat at 34 in New York on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Indosat at 34 in New York on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation (Indosat) closed at 34 in New York on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of 34 and the day's high of 34-5/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 150,200 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 112,000. Its previous close on Wednesday was 34-7/8.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
